ait_Margaret_T..png?v=1788836378\" alt=\"Margaret T.\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"c-pgp-name\">Margaret T.</div>\n            <div class=\"c-pgp-meta\">Grandmother of four &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Illinois <span class=\"c-pgp-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"c-pgp-slide\">\n        <p class=\"c-pgp-text\">&ldquo;This is the one thing that works with my granddaughter. It answers the questions kids really wonder about, in language they get, so they keep turning pages instead of asking for the tablet.&rdquo;</p>\n        <div class=\"c-pgp-author\">\n          <img class=\"c-pgp-avatar\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0610/1463/8726/files/Portrait_Diane.png?v=1788836378\" alt=\"Diane\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"c-pgp-name\">Diane</div>\n            <div class=\"c-pgp-meta\">Grandmother of 1 <span class=\"c-pgp-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"c-pgp-slide\">\n        <p class=\"c-pgp-text\">&ldquo;I bought this book for my adorable granddaughter. She loves to ask questions and sometimes I don&rsquo;t know how to answer it. Now that I&rsquo;ve gifted her this book, we read it together. I will definitely buy more books for my other grandkids!&rdquo;</p>\n        <div class=\"c-pgp-author\">\n          <img class=\"c-pgp-avatar\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0610/1463/8726/files/Portrait_Diane_1.png?v=1788836375\" alt=\"Noah's grandmother\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"c-pgp-name\">Noah&rsquo;s grandmother, 68</div>\n            <div class=\"c-pgp-meta\">Grandmother of 5 <span class=\"c-pgp-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <button class=\"c-pgp-arrow c-pgp-arrow--next\" aria-label=\"Next te